ake/stories/00-foundation.md:92:| FC-0.1 | `pnpm run red-verify` | build + typecheck + lint + boundaries, clean |\ndocs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/stories/00-foundation.md:93:| FC-0.2 | `pnpm run verify-all` | passes with zero behavior tests; labeled CLI-suite skip under `verify` |\ndocs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/stories/00-foundation.md:94:| FC-0.3 | `test/smoke.test.ts` | help, unknown command, stub failure shape |\ndocs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/stories/00-foundation.md:95:| FC-0.4 | `test/fixtures.test.ts` | builder defaults golden-shaped; invalid pairings need explicit casts |\ndocs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/stories/00-foundation.md:96:| FC-0.5 | `test/smoke.test.ts` | golden token counts, repeated runs identical |\ndocs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/stories/00-foundation.md:97:| FC-0.6 | boundary-check self-test | sabotage import fails, clean tree passes |\ndocs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/stories/00-foundation.md:98:| FC-0.7 | gate self-test (recorded, then removed) | failing test fails `verify`; edited Red file fails `green-verify` |\ndocs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/stories/00-foundation.md:105:| Boundary check guards itself | self-test in FC-0.6 | the guard fails when violated | a silently broken guard passes every later story while enforcing nothing |\ndocs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/stories/00-foundation.md:106:| Gates fail correctly | FC-0.7 procedure | gates catch what they exist to catch | a gate that cannot fail certifies nothing |\ndocs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/stories/00-foundation.md:145:- [ ] Smoke suite green (4–6 tests) covering FC-0.1 through FC-0.7; gate self-test (FC-0.7) performed and recorded","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7d47137f-cd86-4c15-bbf8-4a8dc794929e","uuid":"74ad823c-eddb-49aa-8ed0-6c1a3454eb7b","timestamp":"2026-06-10T12:33:33.458Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"docs/02-specs/01-thread-record-and-intake/stories/